pkg:Evidence_v1_28_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.28.0 (STORY-13 closed -- package-install analysis)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user uploaded a real session log confirming the earlier Conformance fix (STORY-11) genuinely holds in real use. Investigated the log's real Code Gen failure by reading the actual code: found the system prompt already correctly forbids network imports and instructs the model to use local data, but the model ignored this on its first attempt and the retry used only a generic correction. Separately confirmed package installation via micropip IS technically functional in this environment (proven by the SHACL worker's own working code) -- the refusal is a deliberate safety choice, not a platform limit. Fixed the one safe, bounded improvement: network/package-flagged retries now get a specific, forceful restatement of the real constraint. Version bumped correctly before committing: all 4 stages moved to v1_8_0, Cross.D verified. Re-verified: all gates PASS fresh, real Playwright 0 errors, pipeline order (42 subjects, reproduces), full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "6f68a4def37afd7fd97e54d3f5208c85abb23513944f319f6ca1410f7f3769c0"^^xsd:string .
